oming County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, April to May and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 34 years. In 2025, April to May hit 152% of normal and August to September fell to 59%. Grid 25715 had its driest year in 1980 at 68% of normal.</p>"}
